// Where Do I Begin (Love Story)

Tempo 82
Keysig G minor

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Groove JazzGuitar1Intro

Begin Solo
    Voice Strings
    Octave 5
    Articulate 105
    Harmony OpenBelow
    Volume mf
    Begin Riff
        2+8b+;8d+;f+;b+;
        2+8a+;8c+;f#+;a+;
        2+8g+;8d+;b;g;
        2b;f#;
    End
End

SwingMode On
Swell mp mf 4

1        Gm
2    F#dim7
3      EbM7
4     D7sus      /     D7


Repeat
Groove JazzGuitar
Decresc m mp 4

5        Gm
6         /
7        D7
8         /

Groove JazzGuitarPlus
Cresc mf 4

9        Gm
10     EbM7      /      /    Eb6
11       D7

RepeatEnding   // ending 1

12        /    D11     D7   D7b9

Groove JazzGuitar

13       Gm
14        /

RepeatEnding  // ending 2

15        /    D11     D7
16      GM7

17       G7    G11     G7   /// music says Next Strain, we dumped the final ending


Groove JazzGuitarSus
Volume m

21       Cm
22       F7
23     BbM7
24     EbM7

Groove JazzGuitarSusPlus
Volume mf

25    Am7b5      /     D7
26       Gm
Decresc m 2
27       Cm
28    F7sus     F7

Groove JazzGuitarSus

29     BbM7
30       Eb
31       A7
Decresc mp 2
32      DM7

33       D7

RepeatEnd  /// we just finished the "B", this is the FINE end

18      D7  D11 D7
Decresc pppp 2
Groove JazzGuitarEnd
19       Gm    EbM7
20       Gm   z!
